  nodes:
  - npcText: 'Hello there

'
    options:
    - text: Hi
      nextNode: 1
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: So you are the chosen one.
    options:
    - text: Me?
      nextNode: 2
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Yes. You were chosen to destroy asteroids and score points.
    options:
    - text: Pretty straightforward.
      nextNode: 3
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Yes it is. Roam around the space, enter asteroid areas and go do your
      job.
    options:
    - text: ...
      nextNode: 4
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: And if you get close to another planet then they will drag you to their
      orbit so you can chat.
    options:
    - text: What do we chat about?
      nextNode: 5
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: 'Oh, many things. Trade, rewards, gibberish and nonsense from time to
      time. '
    options:
    - text: What about asteroids descruction?
      nextNode: 6
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Go into asteroids area. Hit 'SPACE' to shoot, once asteroid is destroyed
      you  recieve points.
    options:
    - text: And if asteroid hits me?
      nextNode: 7
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Oh, you just lose one of your lives and if you lose all them you die.
      And that's it.
    options:
    - text: Oh... wow... that's it? No replay or anything?
      nextNode: 8
      updatesPlanetNode: 1
      newPlanetNode: 9
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: Do you have 10,000 points?
    options:
    - text: No
      nextNode: 11
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
    - text: Yes
      nextNode: 11
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
  - npcText: No, nothing. Come back once you have 10,000 points. This will be your
      small victory for now. Until then - bye!
    options:
    - text: Wait, I still have some questions!
      nextNode: 8
      updatesPlanetNode: 0
      newPlanetNode: 0
      triggersEvent: 0
      eventId: 
